  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "create continuous healing aura, each active cast leveling up the aroma",
    "skill1": "boost ATK and recover energy for allies within the aura",
    "skill2": "instant heal all allies inside aura",
    "skill3": "ATK boost grows with more allies inside aura",
    "skill4": "third aura upgrade increases damage dealt to enemies",
    "skill5": "extra healing on each aura use"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Smokey & Meerky]] anchor fights with a **continuous healing aura** that levels up with each active cast. Allies inside gain ATK and Energy recovery, while another skill instantly heals everyone in the zone. The ATK boost grows with ally count inside the aura, rewarding formations that can stay nearby. A later aura upgrade also increases damage dealt to enemies, blending offense with sustain. The pair underperforms when allies cannot stay inside the zone or when the fight ends before aroma levels build.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Smokey & Meerky]] channel a healing aroma that amplifies allied ATK and Energy while receivers stay inside; control drops the aroma and starts a four-second recreate lockout. Break the channel with [[Lily May]] or stun/sleep CC, then shove receivers out of the moving aura with targeted displacement from [[Mehira]] or [[Reinier]]. Use [[Dunlingr]]'s Curelock with [[Ravion]] or [[Himmel]] when ally healing is the snowball lever, and race the long channel with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]]."
}
